# The Floelane (CIPlay the_floelane): the first floe, the distress card, the winch and the lead to the hull floe, the
# motor wheel's plans, the cage keys (west floe), three cages, the hull bell (signal rescued), the wheelhouse, the thanks.
island The Floelane
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The White Sea
expect hidden icebridge
expect hidden thanks
zone first_floe
expect step 1
read Sealer's distress card
expect step 2
use winch
expect shown icebridge
zone hull
expect step 3
open Engine room
wait 3
expect step 4
read SILENCE ORDER
read A QSL card
expect step 5
use hullbell
expect message not yet
open Sealer's locker
expect story sealkey 3
use cage1
use cage2
use cage3
wait 3
expect survivor frozen_sigrid
expect survivor frozen_bo
expect story sealkey 0
use hullbell
expect story rescued 1
expect shown thanks
expect step 6
# DEEP 10-24: the wheelhouse is locked - the key is on the berg
open Wheelhouse locker
expect step 6
zone berg_foot
expect step 7
zone bear_den
read Lookout's tally
expect step 8
zone berg_top
expect step 9
open Sealers' lookout chest
expect story wheelkey 1
expect step 10
open Wheelhouse locker
wait 3
expect step 11
read Survivors' thanks
expect done
# the extras: the den's cache, the hut, the sister boat, two treasures
open Bear den cache
read Sealers' hut log
open Sealers' chest
zone sister_lead
air sisterair
open Sister boat's strongbox
dig 0
dig 1
wait 40
expect hidden icebridge
